        "TileImage": "$($repository af589e83-295e-48f0-92a2-0065ff201f07).Image",
        "Description": "Jake Warren, Evan Holden, Josh Sinclair and Ewan Roberts are are former ICA operatives, who betrayed the agency and plan to reveal our existence to the world.\rThey started working aboard the &quot;Night Thief&quot;, Kalvin Ritter&apos;s personal Yacht. Jake and Evan are working with the yacht security, and are trying to protect Josh and Ewan, who are currently disguised as mechanics. \rThe Board asked for each of them to be taken out in a different way, and for the least amount of evidence possible on the boat.",
